# A1_7 "Huleeya Informant": Huleeya will only talk at her friend's bookstore,
# so the player escorts her there past three racist thugs. She follows on her
# own AiFollowCell through both doors; the walk between them is hers to make.
# The console steps name references by their FormID in the test instance,
# where Morrowind.esm loads at slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from a1_7_escort
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# She agrees to come along (choice 1); the thugs attack, and fall. Damage
# stands in for the fight: the console's kill leaves health untouched, which
# no blow does.
case a1_7_escort
run
player->PositionCell 630 -347 -40 90 "Vivec, Black Shalk Cornerclub"
until 600 GetPCCell "Vivec, Black Shalk Cornerclub" == 1
talk huleeya
ask friend's bookstore
expect GetJournalIndex A1_7HuleeyaInformant == 1
ask troublesome fools
expect GetJournalIndex A1_7HuleeyaInformant == 2
ask travel together
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex A1_7HuleeyaInformant == 18
bye
console 05B758D0.damageav health 1000
console 054BCDFC.damageav health 1000
console 05CCA07B.damageav health 1000
until 300 "favel gobor"->GetHealth <= 0
until 300 "urven davor"->GetHealth <= 0
until 300 "ethys savil"->GetHealth <= 0
expect "huleeya"->GetCurrentAiPackage == 3
end

# Out the cornerclub door, along the waistworks (Position stands in for the
# walk) and in at Jobasha's, with Huleeya behind; her script marks the arrival
# and she greets the player, offering what she knows of the Nerevarine cult.
case a1_7_walk
console 05AC32C1.activate player
until 600 GetPCCell "Vivec, Foreign Quarter Lower Waistworks" == 1
until 900 "huleeya"->GetDistance player < 500
run
player->Position 2316 3800 13540 0
until 1800 "huleeya"->GetDistance player < 500
console 053F6059.activate player
until 600 GetPCCell "Vivec, Jobasha's Rare Books" == 1
until 1800 GetJournalIndex A1_7HuleeyaInformant == 20
until 300 MenuMode == 1
ask Nerevarine cult
expect GetJournalIndex A1_7HuleeyaInformant == 50
expect player->GetItemCount bk_a1_7_huleeyainformant == 1
bye
end
